OL,3,GNEWSARise in permanent exclusions in
OL,4,Aborough's schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuthers' report stated that while there
OL,7,Fwas an increase in permanent
OL,8,Fexclusions, temporary suspensions had
OL,9,Fsignificantly decreased.
